    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Three Kingdoms Under Siege&quot;\u200b\u200b is a war strategy game set in the Three Kingdoms era, uniquely blending auto-chess mechanics and endless challenge modes to deliver a fresh tactical experience. The game emphasizes \u200bdynamic resource allocation\u200b and \u200badaptive troop deployment\u200b for deeper battlefield control. Strengthen your forces through \u200bhero upgrades\u200b and \u200bunit synthesis\u200b to secure ultimate victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat system features \u200breal-time strategy\u200b fused with \u200bcard-drafting tactics, where players must master \u200bunit counters, \u200bsynthesis synergies, and \u200bsupply line management\u200b to dominate both \u200bPVE campaigns\u200b and \u200bPVP battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, the game introduces \u200balliance-based gameplay, enabling players to relive the \u200b\u200b&quot;Vertical &amp; Horizontal Alliances&quot;\u200b\u200b of Three Kingdoms conquest\u2014forge coalitions, betray rivals, and carve your path to supremacy!</p>",
